      412.69,
      538.05,
      447.76
    ],
    "text": "BY VIRTUE of the powers vested in me by Section 23 W of the National Environmental Act, No. 47 of 1980 read withSection 51of the Nineteenth Amendment to the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, MaithripalaSirisena, President, do by this Order prohibit the activities specified in Schedule hereto.",
